ct_html": "<p><b>Aberdeen Falls</b> is a 98\u00a0m (322\u00a0ft) high waterfall on the Kehelgamu Oya near Ginigathena, in the Nuwara Eliya District of Sri Lanka. Kehelgamu Oya is a major tributary of the Kelani River. The waterfall is ranked as the 18th highest on the Island.</p>"}